<tr class=gbg><td class= msgboard valign=top ><span class=orangetext>RE: Updates to the message board</span></td><td class= msgboard valign=top>Today I added the feature of viewing messages even if the person viewing it has no login/password. You still have to log in to get to post, but that's not really a big deal.</td><td align=right class= msgboardgraytext valign=top ><b>shepler</b><br /><font size=-1>06.03.200<br />10:44</font></td></tr><tr class=ybg><td class= msgboard valign=top ><span class=orangetext>RE: Updates to the message board</span></td><td class= msgboard valign=top>rock on man. so now you have public viewing, and only registration to post.. sounds like time to bring in the msg board trolls and lurkers. heh</td><td align=right class= msgboardgraytext valign=top ><b>rasilt</b><br /><font size=-1>06.03.200<br />10:54</font></td></tr><tr class=gbg><td class= msgboard valign=top ><span class=orangetext>SSL Login and Registration added</span></td><td class= msgboard valign=top>I added the stuff to the server and updated links to allow SSL connections for loging in and also for registering new users.</td><td align=right class= msgboardgraytext valign=top ><b>shepler</b><br /><font size=-1>06.03.200<br />11:58</font></td></tr><tr class=ybg><td class= msgboard valign=top ><span class=orangetext>Modifying the initial display of the threads</span></td><td class= msgboard valign=top>I changed the main thread listing page to list the currently listed threads by the First message posted's subject, but contain the text, user, and time from the most recent post.</td><td align=right class= msgboardgraytext valign=top ><b>shepler</b><br /><font size=-1>06.03.200<br />12:16</font></td></tr><tr class=gbg><td class= msgboard valign=top ><span class=orangetext>RE: Updates to the message board</span></td><td class= msgboard valign=top>I changed te date in the database to have 10 instead of 9 characters since the 2 at the end of 2002 was getting inadvertently chopped. </td><td align=right class= msgboardgraytext valign=top ><b>shepler</b><br /><font size=-1>06.05.2002<br />22:44</font></td></tr></table>
